{"content": "The salt spray stung Elias\u2019s eyes as he hauled the tangled net onto the deck. Amidst the writhing silver of caught fish, something glassy caught the dying light. He pulled it free: a bottle, heavy with sand and silence. His weathered hands trembled as he uncorked it. The paper inside was yellowed, the ink faded to a ghostly blue. It wasn\u2019t a distress signal, nor a map. It was a name. *Elias.* His own name, written in a hand he hadn\u2019t seen in thirty years. The wind howled, but the world held its breath, waiting for him to read the rest.", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.2157543525954857, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "The", "logprob": -0.2157543525954857}, {"token": "E", "logprob": -1.8136356697341576}, {"token": "El", "logprob": -4.580099903132595}, {"token": "Salt", "logprob": -4.948584400202908}, {"token": "Rain", "logprob": -5.329787097956814}, {"token": "Sil", "logprob": -6.572882495906033}, {"token": "Arthur", "logprob": -6.7026546821853294}, {"token": "Ell", "logprob": -6.771126590754665}, {"token": "M", "logprob": -7.029675327326931}, {"token": "Old", "logprob": -8.03474696734158}, {"token": "G", "logprob": -8.179758869197048}, {"token": "Wind", "logprob": -8.321441494013943}, {"token": "For", "logprob": -8.620231472041286}, {"token": " Elias", "logprob": -8.727760158564724}, {"token": "H", "logprob": -8.762112461115994}, {"token": "Har", "logprob": -8.803706966426052}, {"token": "Sal", "logprob": -8.951315723445095}, {"token": "S", "logprob": -9.203987918879665}, {"token": "Thomas", "logprob": -9.204918705012478}, {"token": "Fort", "logprob": -9.288956485774197}]}, {"token": " salt", "logprob": -1.060903436191488, "top_logprobs": [{"token": " salt", "logprob": -1.060903436191488}, {"token": " storm", "logprob": -1.4602488341407067}, {"token": " fog", "logprob": -2.076963311679769}, {"token": " wind", "logprob": -2.449342614658285}, {"token": " g", "logprob": -2.5719126525000817}, {"token": " rain", "log